#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:1
msgid "Krita's fill tool reference."
msgstr "介绍 Krita 的填充工具 (油漆桶) 的使用方式。"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:11
msgid "Tools"
msgstr "工具"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:11
msgid "Fill"
msgstr "填充"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:11
msgid "Bucket"
msgstr "油漆桶"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:16
msgid "Fill Tool"
msgstr "填充工具"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:18
msgid "|toolfill|"
msgstr "|toolfill|"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:20
msgid ""
"Krita has one of the most powerful and capable Fill functions available. The "
"options found in the Tool Options docker and outlined below will give you a "
"great deal of flexibility working with layers and selections."
msgstr ""
"填充工具，俗称油漆桶工具，是用来把前景色填充到与点击位置颜色邻近的一整片区域"
"的工具。它的工具选项可以调整容差、边缘羽化和限制图层等常用参数。"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:22
msgid ""
"To get started, clicking anywhere on screen with the fill-tool will allow "
"that area to be filed with the foreground color."
msgstr ""
"选中填充工具后，左键点击画布的任意位置即可进行填充。按 :kbd:`E` 键切换至擦除"
"模式后，还可以用相同算法擦除颜色邻近的整片区域。"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:25
msgid "Tool Options"
msgstr "工具选项"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:27
msgid "Fast Mode"
msgstr "高速模式"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:28
msgid ""
"This is a special mode for really fast filling. However, many functions "
"don't work with this mode."
msgstr ""
"勾选后，填充模式的处理速度将大幅提升，但扩大/缩小选区和羽化选项将不可用，且图"
"层的混合模式将不被纳入处理范畴。"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:29
msgid "Threshold"
msgstr "颜色容差"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:30
msgid "Determines when the fill-tool sees another color as a border."
msgstr ""
"该值用于控制被填充区域的颜色可以与点击处颜色存在多大差异。如果你发现填充工具"
"的填充范围太大，可以适当降低此数值。"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:31
msgid "Grow Selection"
msgstr "扩大/缩小填充区域"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:32
msgid "This value extends the shape beyond its initial size."
msgstr "该值用于控制被填充区域相对于实际的邻近色区域向外扩大/向内收缩的程度。"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:33
msgid "Feathering Radius"
msgstr "羽化半径"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:34
msgid "This value will add a soft border to the filled-shape."
msgstr "该值用于控制在填充区域边缘添加的柔和过渡区域的大小。"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:36
msgid ""
"Activating this will result in the shape filling the whole of the active "
"selection, regardless of threshold."
msgstr ""
"勾选后将无视当前选区内的颜色情况，直接把当前选区整个填满。部分工具选项将不可"
"用。"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:41
msgid ""
"When checked, this will count the borders of the selection as an extra "
"boundary on top of the pixel difference."
msgstr "勾选后，相连颜色采样区域不能越过选区轮廓"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:44
msgid "Use selection as boundary"
msgstr "采样区域受选区限制"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:45
msgid "Fill Entire Selection"
msgstr "直接填满当前选区"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:45
msgid ""
"Left: Original selection with a line. Middle: Filled with 'use selection as "
"boundary' off. Right: Filled with 'use selection as boundary' on."
msgstr ""
"左图：演示素材，选区被一条细线截断成两块；中图：填充时不勾选“采样区域受选区限"
"制”；右图：填充时勾选“采样区域受选区限制”"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:48
msgid "Ticking this will result in the active pattern being used."
msgstr "勾选后直接填充当前图案，不填充前景色。"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:52
msgid "Rotation"
msgstr "旋转"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:53
msgid "This allows you to rotate the pattern used in the fill."
msgstr "对填充的图案进行旋转。"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:57
msgid "Use Pattern"
msgstr "填充图案"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:57
msgid "Scale"
msgstr "缩放"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:57
msgid "This allows you to scale the pattern used in the fill."
msgstr "对填充的图案进行缩放。"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:62
msgid ""
"Select which layers to use as a reference for the fill tool. The options are:"
msgstr "选择填充工具应在哪些图层上进行采样，选项包括："

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:64
msgid "Current Layer"
msgstr "当前图层"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:65
msgid "Only use the currently selected layer."
msgstr "只对当前图层颜色进行采样以确定填充区域。"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:66
msgid "All layers"
msgstr "所有图层"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:67
msgid "Use all visible layers."
msgstr "对所有图层合并后的颜色进行采样以填充区域。"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:69
msgid "Sample"
msgstr "采样图层"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:69
msgid "Color Labeled Layers"
msgstr "选择图层颜色标签"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:69
msgid ""
"Use only the layers specified with a certain color label. This is useful for "
"complex images, where you might have multiple lineart layers. Label them "
"with the appropriate color label and use these labels to mark which layers "
"to use as a reference."
msgstr ""
"只对标有所选颜色标签的图层的颜色进行采样以确定填充区域。如果你的图层非常多，"
"以至于已经在使用颜色标签在管理，这可以提高工作效率。"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/fill.rst:74
msgid "Used with the 'Color Labeled Layers' option above."
msgstr "只在选择“选择图层颜色标签”时可用。勾选用于采样的图层的颜色标签。"
